{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0624c943-a7b2-8cdf-8c1d-a83ffc7975c4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T14:09:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Zelia Brito",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:06:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:06:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. My name is Zelia Brito. I am calling about a dog. My mother's dog is lost, and I want to put, um, the poster. I want to register it with the city. Is that the right office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:06:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a good place to start, hon. I can take the lost dog report and pass it along to animal control. How long has the dog been missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:06:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Saturday morning. He went out the back gate and [line breaks up] did not come back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up on me there. He went out the back gate, and then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:06:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the gate. Somebody left it open. He did not come back, two days now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:07:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got it. Can you describe him for me? Size, color, anything like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:07:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He is medium, maybe thirty pounds. Short hair, brown, like a, a reddish brown, with a white patch on the chest and white on the front feet. One ear stands up and one is folded. He has a blue collar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:07:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, he sounds sweet. Does he have a name, and is he microchipped, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:07:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "His name is Bolinha. The chip, I am not sure. [pause] Let me ask. [speaking Creole to relative] Mãe, Bolinha tem chip? [pause] She says yes, from the vet, a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that helps if someone brings him in. And where was he last seen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:07:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "At the house. It is 172 Gidley Street, in the Fifth Ward. My mother lives there, and I am helping her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:07:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "172 Gidley Street, got it. Now you said a poster. Do you already have one made?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:07:56-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I made it last night. I draw a little, I like to sketch strangers on the bus, so I did a drawing of him for the poster, with his face. I want to put it up on the poles and in the store windows. Is it allowed, or I need to register it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:08:13-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's lovely. Generally you can bring a copy in or send one, and we'll attach it to the report so animal control has his picture. For posting on poles, I'd check with them on the rules before you put them up everywhere. I can put a note on it for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:08:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yes please. Can I bring the poster here to City Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:08:34-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can. Come by the clerk's office window during the day, and we'll make a copy for the file. Today we close at the usual time, and with the holiday this week, I'd come in before Wednesday if you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:08:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can come tomorrow morning. [line breaks up] ...the number, if they find him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:08:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out. You want a number to put on the report for callbacks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:08:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0193. That is my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:09:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0193. Perfect. Zelia Brito, Bolinha, medium reddish-brown dog, white chest, one folded ear, blue collar, last seen at 172 Gidley Street. Did I get it right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:09:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:09:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. I'll send this to animal control now. I hope he turns up soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:09:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
